---
title: "From a file in the repository to a template card"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: building
    lg1: browsing
    lg2: reading
  }
  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 teal
  class lg2 purple
  s0: Nothing listed yet
  s1: A record was read from the repository
  s2: Cards are on the page
  s3: The filters match nothing
  s4: The detail page is open
  s5: The filters match some cards
  s6: The use command is shown
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: the build reads a file from the repository
  s1 --> s2: the page lists a card for that file
  s2 --> s3: you set a filter that matches nothing
  s2 --> s4: you open the card
  s2 --> s5: you set a filter that keeps the card
  s3 --> s2: you go back to the full list
  s4 --> s2: you go back to the full list
  s4 --> s6: you choose Use
  s5 --> s2: you go back to the full list
  s5 --> s3: you set a filter that matches nothing
  s5 --> s4: you open the card
  s6 --> s2: you go back to the full list
  class s0 blue
  class s1 blue
  class s2 teal
  class s3 teal
  class s4 purple
  class s5 teal
  class s6 purple
